@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "0199a1b2-0000-7000-8000-000000000001",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "0199a1b2-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a1", "productName": "Book", "unitPrice": 49.90, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "0199a1b2-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a2", "productName": "Bookmark", "unitPrice": 5.00, "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}

### Get order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Place order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/place

### Place order again (expect 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/place

### Get non-existent order (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Pay order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay

### Ship order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/ship

### Cancel shipped order (expect 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel